「ありのまま」なんて 誰に見せるんだ
Who am I going to show "just the way I am" to?

208
00:20:23,932 --> 00:20:26,442
馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
A foolish me just sings

209
00:20:26,442 --> 00:20:28,992
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Shall I spill it all out to the stars?

210
00:20:28,992 --> 00:20:31,392
エリクサーに張り替える作業もなんとなくなんだ
Replacing strings with Elixir is also just a haphazard task

211
00:20:31,392 --> 00:20:33,262
欠けた爪を少し触る
I touch my chipped fingernail slightly

212
00:20:33,262 --> 00:20:36,242
半径300mmの体で 必死に鳴いている
With a body of 300mm radius, I'm desperately crying out

213
00:20:36,242 --> 00:20:38,612
音楽にとつちゅう ここが地球だな
To music, this place is the Earth

214
00:20:38,612 --> 00:20:41,742
空気を掴んで 空を殴るよ
Clenching the air, I punch the sky

215
00:21:50,952 --> 00:21:51,952
窓を開けて 小さく呟いた
I opened the window and murmured softly

216
00:21:51,952 --> 00:21:54,452
誰もしない 部屋で一人
Alone in an empty room

217
00:21:54,452 --> 00:21:57,352
朝が来たよ 土砂降りの朝が
Morning has come, a pouring rainy morning

218
00:21:57,352 --> 00:22:00,552
私のネジを 誰か巻いて
Someone, wind up my spring

219
00:22:00,852 --> 00:22:03,402
昔のアニメにそんなのいたっけな
Was there anyone like that in old anime?

220
00:22:03,402 --> 00:22:06,002
羨ましいな 皆に愛されて
I'm so envious, being loved by everyone

221
00:22:06,002 --> 00:22:09,352
馬鹿な事言ってないで支度をしなくちゃ
Stop saying foolish things and get ready

222
00:22:09,352 --> 00:22:12,352
涙の跡を隠す為
To hide the traces of my tears

223
00:22:12,352 --> 00:22:15,152
もう口癖になった「まあいいか」
"Whatever" has already become my catchphrase

224
00:22:15,152 --> 00:22:18,152
昨日の言葉がふと頭を過る
Yesterday's words suddenly crossed my mind

225
00:22:18,152 --> 00:22:21,352
「もう君には 全然期待してないから」
"I'm not expecting anything from you anymore at all"

226
00:22:21,352 --> 00:22:24,552
そりゃまあ私だって 自分に期待などしてないけれど
Well, of course, I don't expect anything of myself either

227
00:22:24,552 --> 00:22:28,552
アレは一体どういうつもりですか
But what on earth do you mean by that?

228
00:22:28,552 --> 00:22:31,352
喉元まで出かかった言葉
Words that came up to my throat

229
00:22:31,352 --> 00:22:34,052
口をついて出たのは嘘
The lie that slipped out of my mouth

230
00:22:34,052 --> 00:22:36,652
こうして今日も私は貴重な
And so today again, I live on

231
00:22:36,652 --> 00:22:39,052
